WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.375
Step 6 is the one to remember.

2
00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:06.125
Append one line to a recorded
tickets file, and check again.

3
00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.288
Both checks fail.

4
00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:09.037
The sums say the file changed,

5
00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:12.975
and the chain says it no longer
matches its record, naming the file.

6
00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:16.200
That's what protects the evidence
from an edit after the fact.

7
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.663
Step 7 runs the evidence
tests: all pass, none fail.

8
00:00:20.663 --> 00:00:23.072
Before step 6, you had a folder whose hash

9
00:00:23.072 --> 00:00:25.700
file you could hand to
the security officer.

10
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.980
Delete the output folder when you're done.
